---
// No props: the block heading is the first `## …` inside the block, written in the MDX.
// It has to be Markdown, not rendered here, so that Astro lists it in the page headings
// and the table of contents shows it in the article view. The controller reads the step
// label from that heading.
---

{/*
	A main Learn block. One block equals one step in the stepper view. It renders as a
	plain section, not a DBSection: the article already sits in the layout's DBSection,
	and a nested DBSection adds its viewport-based inline padding a second time, which
	indents the content against the headline.
*/}
<section class="learn-section learn-block" data-learn-block>
	<slot />
</section>
